WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:03.480
Sir Dillard looked at the new technology hub building.

2
00:00:03.481 --> 00:00:07.205
A crane lifted a steel beam up to workers on the roof.

3
00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:12.097
The knight saw a truck pull up to the entrance.

4
00:00:12.098 --> 00:00:16.049
A man got out and opened the back.

5
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.301
"I have computers," he said. "Where should I put them?"

6
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:23.172
"Second floor," someone said.

7
00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:25.284
The truck driver grabbed a computer.

8
00:00:25.285 --> 00:00:27.692
He carried it toward the entrance.

9
00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:32.729
"I can't stand computers!" Sir Dillard charged toward the driver.

10
00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:36.510
Smash! Sir Dillard's lance went through the computer.

11
00:00:36.511 --> 00:00:38.498
Pieces flew everywhere.

12
00:00:38.499 --> 00:00:42.462
The driver fell backward. "Hey!" he shouted.

13
00:00:42.463 --> 00:00:44.240
"Why did you do that?"

14
00:00:44.241 --> 00:00:49.408
"Your modern technology is an insult to the queen!" Sir Dillard said.

15
00:00:49.409 --> 00:00:53.455
The driver scratched his head. "What are you talking about?"

16
00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:54.838
Sir Dillard didn't answer.

17
00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.825
He glanced over his shoulder and shouted. "Brave knights! Attack!"

18
00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.999
Two knights ran over.

19
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:09.491
One drew a sword and slashed the truck's tires.

20
00:01:09.492 --> 00:01:13.258
"Excellent work, Lady Jane!" Sir Dillard said.

21
00:01:13.259 --> 00:01:19.728
Lady Jane took off her helmet. "Thank you, sir!"

22
00:01:19.729 --> 00:01:23.309
Another knight picked up a computer and threw it.

23
00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:27.843
Smash! Then he kicked a window.

24
00:01:27.844 --> 00:01:30.575
"For the queen!" he shouted.

25
00:01:30.576 --> 00:01:35.163
Sir Dillard puffed out his chest. "Wonderful, Sir Jerry!"

26
00:01:35.164 --> 00:01:37.650
The knights continued to smash things.

27
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:40.278
The workers dropped their tools and ran. "Knights

28
00:01:40.279 --> 00:01:42.449
are attacking us!" "Run

29
00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.407
for your lives!" Sir

30
00:01:45.408 --> 00:01:49.173
Dillard held up his sword. "Victory!" Lady

31
00:01:49.174 --> 00:01:54.529
Jane and Sir Jerry held up their swords. "Victory!" Sir

32
00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.891
Dillard got down from his horse. He

33
00:01:56.892 --> 00:01:59.136
walked to the building's entrance. "I

34
00:01:59.137 --> 00:02:03.293
claim this building for Her Majesty, the queen!" He

35
00:02:03.294 --> 00:02:05.290
turned to face the other knights. "Metro

36
00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.186
City has enough technology. Everywhere

37
00:02:08.187 --> 00:02:13.658
I look, I see computers, smartphones, and electrical wires. Thanks

38
00:02:13.659 --> 00:02:18.797
to you, brave knights, this technology hub will never be finished!" "Hooray!"

39
00:02:18.798 --> 00:02:22.511
the knights shouted. ***

40
00:02:22.512 --> 00:02:27.696
"That Kingdom Festival was fun!" Jack waved around a plastic sword.

41
00:02:27.697 --> 00:02:30.518
Roxy and her friends were in Mara's backyard.

42
00:02:30.519 --> 00:02:34.510
"I have a bad feeling about Sir Dillard," Roxy said.

43
00:02:34.511 --> 00:02:37.855
"He got really angry about that guy's phone."

44
00:02:37.856 --> 00:02:44.472
Mara chuckled. "He was just pretending. It's part of his act."

45
00:02:44.473 --> 00:02:47.622
"Yeah," Jack said. "He's supposed to be a knight.

46
00:02:47.623 --> 00:02:50.810
So he was acting like he didn't know what a phone is."

47
00:02:50.811 --> 00:02:55.855
"He also acted like the queen is really a queen," Terrell said.

48
00:02:55.856 --> 00:02:57.936
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

49
00:02:57.937 --> 00:03:03.427
She stepped away from her friends.

50
00:03:03.428 --> 00:03:05.406
She opened her watch.

51
00:03:05.407 --> 00:03:07.840
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

52
00:03:07.841 --> 00:03:14.898
"We need your help! Knights took over Metro City's new technology hub!"

